    "body": "I ran a probe with 9 cases (an SVG text control, not shown, printed sharp everywhere) in Chrome, Firefox and Safari and printed each to PDF. Each canvas is 20×10 px shown at 160×80 CSS px, shows \"A\" at load, and some cases draw \"B\" at print time. \"sharp\" means the letter is text in the PDF, \"pixelated\" means it is an embedded 20×10 image.\n\n| Case (print-time drawing) | Chrome Canary 159.0.8153.0 | Firefox Nightly 162.0a1 | Safari TP 256 (22627.1.6.3) |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| none | A, pixelated | A, pixelated | A, pixelated |\n| `beforeprint`: `clearRect` whole canvas, then B | **B, sharp** | B, pixelated | B, pixelated |\n| `beforeprint`: B only, no clear | A+B, pixelated | A+B, pixelated | A+B, pixelated |\n| `beforeprint`: `fillRect` whole canvas, then B | B, pixelated | B, pixelated | B, pixelated |\n| `beforeprint`: `clearRect`, B, then `putImageData` | B, pixelated | B, pixelated | B, pixelated |\n| `beforeprint`: `clearRect`, then B, `image-rendering: pixelated` | B, pixelated | B, pixelated | B, pixelated |\n| `beforeprint`: `reset()`, then B | **B, sharp** | B, pixelated | B, pixelated |\n| `mozPrintCallback`: `clearRect`, then B | A, pixelated | **B, sharp** | A, pixelated |\n\nSo a page gets vector output in Chromium only if it wipes the canvas with `clearRect` or `reset()` before redrawing; painting it over with `fillRect` is not enough. Correction to the description above: `fillRect` does not count as a full clear.\n\nProbe and PDFs: \n\n[run-2026-11-10-safari-tp-256-22627.1.6.3-canvas-print-vector.pdf](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/34604668/run-2026-11-10-safari-tp-256-22627.1.6.3-canvas-print-vector.pdf)\n[run-2026-11-10-firefox-nightly-162.0a1-canvas-print-vector.pdf](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/34604666/run-2026-11-10-firefox-nightly-162.0a1-canvas-print-vector.pdf)\n[run-2026-11-10-chrome-canary-159.0.8153.0-canvas-print-vector.pdf](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/34604667/run-2026-11-10-chrome-canary-159.0.8153.0-canvas-print-vector.pdf)\n[probe-canvas-print-vector.html](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/34604665/probe-canvas-print-vector.html)",
